{"ID":"20240205153746-kr7n9at","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153746-kr7n9at","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153746-kr7n9at\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135513-atx62rp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205161423-lsknnxy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135513-atx62rp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:115,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:115\u0026#125;","title":"香加皮（北五加皮、羊奶条）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903091710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135513-atx62rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135513-atx62rp","updated":"20240206135522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山西、河南、河北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t呈卷筒状，少数为不规则卷片，厚2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4mm。外表面灰棕色或黄棕色，栓皮易鳞片状剥落而现黄白色内皮；内表面淡黄色或红棕色，有细纵纹。质脆，断面不整齐，淡黄色。有特异香气，味苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温，有毒。\n【功效】\t利水消肿，祛风湿，强筋骨。用于下肢浮肿、心悸气，风寒湿痹，腰膝酸软。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135514-481bkji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135514-481bkji","updated":"20240206135514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135514-n20l1ol.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161423-lsknnxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161423-lsknnxy","updated":"20240205161423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"香加皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/香加皮-20240205161423-3xv3ant.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729163658-sllxfy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729163658-sllxfy8","updated":"20240729164028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 422px;","style":"width: 412px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杠柳 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杠柳 1-20240729163943-c6f8sy5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 412px;\" parent-style=\"width: 422px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 422px;","style":"width: 412px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杠柳 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杠柳 2-20240729164028-jyizdxx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 412px;\" parent-style=\"width: 422px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 365px;","style":"width: 355px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杠柳"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杠柳-20240729163743-l0hf4uk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 355px;\" parent-style=\"width: 365px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729165624-b8pg8l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729165624-b8pg8l8","updated":"20240729165624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 552px;","style":"width: 542px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"